  https://www.qagraphics.com/
* The BACnet external-reference fields follow ASHRAE 223P (2nd public review
  draft, section 11.18.1). The bacnet://<device>/<type>,<instance> URI shape
  matches the BACpypes3 BACnet-to-RDF sample layout (samples/bacnet-rdf).

